dana\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">무기</span></b></font></a><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"> | </span></b></font><a href=\"/site/Diablo2/euarmor/\"><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">아머</span></b></font></a></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;</span></font></p>\n<table align=\"center\" border=\"1\" bordercolor=\"#999933\" bordercolordark=\"#A0965A\" bordercolorlight=\"#999933\" cellpadding=\"7\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\" width=\"580\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#F8F8F8\" colspan=\"3\" height=\"30\" width=\"562\">\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><a href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20021120025121/http://hosting27.interpia98.net:80/~forg/Diablo2/sets7.shtml#sandersfolly\" target=\"_blank\"><font color=\"#996600\" face=\"Verdana\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;</span></b></font></a><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana,helvetica\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">Exceptional Unique PoleArms \n                             \n                            </span></b></font><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">[익셉셔널 유니크 풀암]</span></b></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"black\" width=\"97\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana,helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><img data-original-src=\"http://hosting27.interpia98.net:80/~forg/Diablo2/images/item/unique/meatscraper.gif\" data-recovery=\"missing\" height=\"105\" src=\"/img/placeholder/missing.svg\" width=\"45\">\n</span></font></p><center>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana,helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><font color=\"#908858\"><b>The Meat \nScraper</b></font></span></font>\n</p><p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"white\" face=\"Verdana,helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">Lochaber Axe</span></font></p></center></td>\n<td width=\"219\">\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana,helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">Two-Hand Damage: <font color=\"#4850b8\">(17.5-21) To (147.5-177)</font> (82.5-99 Avg)<br>Required Level: \n41<br>Required Strength: 80<br>Durability: 50<br>Base Weapon Speed: \n[10]<br><font color=\"#4850b8\">+150-200% Enhanced Damage</font>(varies)<br><font color=\"#4850b8\">50% Chance Of Open Wounds</font><br><font color=\"#4850b8\">30% \nIncreased Attack Speed</font><br><font color=\"#4850b8\">10% Life Stolen Per \nHit</font><br><font color=\"#4850b8\">25% Better Chance Of Getting Magic \nItems</font><br><font color=\"#4850b8\">+3 To Masteries (Barbarian \nOnly)</font><br>(Only Spawns In Patch 1.09 or later) </span></font> </p></td>\n<td width=\"214\">\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana,helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">양손 \n                            데미지: <font color=\"#4850b8\">(17.5-21) To (147.5-177)</font> (82.5-99 Avg)<br>레벨 요구치 : \n41<br>힘 요구치 : 80<br>내구력 : 50<br>무기기본속도 : \n[10]<br><font color=\"#4850b8\">+150-200% 증가된 데미지 </font>(varies)<br><font color=\"#4850b8\">50% 상처회복 저지</font><br><font color=\"#4850b8\">30% 공격속도증가</font><br><font color=\"#4850b8\">공격명중시 10% 라이프 획득</font><br><font color=\"#4850b8\">25%매직아이템얻을 확률 증가</font><br><font color=\"#4850b8\">+3 To Masteries (바바리안전용)</font><br>(Only Spawns In Patch 1.09 or later) </span></font> </p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"black\" width=\"97\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana,helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><img data-original-src=\"http://hosting27.interpia98.net:80/~forg/Diablo2/images/item/unique/voul